Let's be honest - I didn’t know Saskatchewan was a real place

We passed Manitoba so fast - I was like ‘yep, see you later Saskatchewan’

I was so wrong! We stopped at a random Tim Hortons - worked there for a while - Rohit looked at the map & saw a lake - we biked there - best bike ride ever! A lake on a low plane - surrounded by green rolling hills. It was amazing! I will be back for sure!

Drive Update: 5731km

Number of Self-Realizations: 159

